    {
      "type": "section",
      "number": "32",
      "id": "32",
      "title": "Other deductions.",
      "line_start": 4,
      "page_start": 1,
      "page_end": 1,
      "text": "32. The following amounts shall be allowed as deduction in computing income chargeable under section 26:—",
      "subsections": [],
      "children": [],
      "clauses": [
        {
          "type": "clause",
          "number": "a",
          "id": "32-a",
          "indent": 0,
          "line_start": 6,
          "page_start": 1,
          "page_end": 1,
          "text": "(a) bonus or commission paid to an employee for services rendered, but only when such amount would not have been payable to the employee as profits or dividend if it had not been paid as bonus or commission;",
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "type": "clause",
          "number": "b",
          "id": "32-b",
          "indent": 0,
          "line_start": 7,
          "page_start": 1,
          "page_end": 1,
          "text": "(b) interest paid in respect of capital borrowed for the purposes of business or profession, where—",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "sub_clause",
              "number": "i",
              "id": "32-b-i",
              "indent": 1,
              "line_start": 8,
              "page_start": 1,
              "page_end": 1,
              "text": "(i) such interest shall not include interest on capital borrowed for acquisition of an asset, whether capitalised in the books of account or not, for any period beginning from the date the capital was borrowed for acquisition of the asset till the date that asset was first put to use;",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "type": "sub_clause",
              "number": "ii",
              "id": "32-b-ii",
              "indent": 1,
              "line_start": 9,
              "page_start": 1,
              "page_end": 1,
              "text": "(ii) recurring subscriptions paid periodically by shareholders or subscribers in Mutual Benefit Societies fulfilling the conditions as may be prescribed, shall be deemed to be capital borrowed;",
              "children": [],
              "references": [
                {
                  "reference_id": "ref-32-b-ii-003",
                  "target_id": "Income Tax Act 2025",
                  "target_type": "external_act",
                  "anchor_text": "prescribed",
                  "relationship": "depends_on",
                  "confidence": "high",
                  "detected_by": "llm"
                },
                {
                  "reference_id": "ref-32-b-ii-004",
                  "target_id": "32-b",
                  "target_type": "clause",
                  "anchor_text": "capital borrowed",
                  "relationship": "defines_term",
                  "confidence": "high",
                  "detected_by": "llm"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "clause",
          "number": "c",
          "id": "32-c",
          "indent": 0,
          "line_start": 10,
          "page_start": 1,
          "page_end": 1,
          "text": "(c) contribution paid by a public financial institution to the credit guarantee fund trust for small industries as the Central Government may, by notification, specify;",
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "type": "clause",
          "number": "d",
          "id": "32-d",
          "indent": 0,
          "line_start": 11,
          "page_start": 1,
          "page_end": 1,
          "text": "(d) the pro rata amount of discount on a zero coupon bond having regard to the period of life of such bond calculated in the manner, as may be prescribed, where—",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "sub_clause",
              "number": "i",
              "id": "32-d-i",
              "indent": 1,
              "line_start": 12,
              "page_start": 1,
              "page_end": 1,
              "text": "(i) \"discount\" means the difference between the amount received or receivable by the infrastructure capital company or infrastructure capital fund or public sector company or scheduled bank issuing the bond, and the amount payable on maturity or redemption of such bond;",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "type": "sub_clause",
              "number": "ii",
              "id": "32-d-ii",
              "indent": 1,
              "line_start": 13,
              "page_start": 1,
              "page_end": 1,
              "text": "(ii) \"period of life of bond\" means the period commencing from the date of issue of the bond and ending on the date of the maturity or redemption of such bond;",
              "children": []
            }
          ],
          "references": [
            {
              "reference_id": "ref-32-d-005",
              "target_id": [
